  'SELECT id FROM files WHERE owner_id = $1 AND name = $2',
  [req.user.id, name]
)
if (!rows.length) return res.sendStatus(404)
```

The most robust design is to look up files by an opaque ID in the DB and map it to a stored path the server generated. Then user input never touches the filesystem path at all.

